      "content": "It sounds like you are in an incredibly dark place, and the weight of feeling completely trapped is immense. If the system is designed to crush you, then the thought of ending the pain is a natural response to that unbearable pressure. Please know that there are people who want to help you navigate this crisis moment, even if the long-term solutions feel impossible right now. You can connect with compassionate support by calling or texting 988 anytime in the US and Canada.",
